  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Gov't Spec 2-Ply Multicam Fatigue Army Ranger Cap combines durability and comfort, ideal for outdoor enthusiasts and those on the go. Constructed from lightweight and tough cotton rip-stop material, this cap resists wear and tear while offering excellent breathability. The Multicam&reg; fabric, licensed through Crye Industries, ensures a stylish and practical design. This cap features a loop strap on the back, perfect for attaching branch and name tape for personalization.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "1257",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Gov't Spec 2-Ply Multicam Fatigue Army Ranger Cap combines durability and comfort, ideal for outdoor enthusiasts and those on the go. Constructed from lightweight and tough cotton rip-stop material, this cap resists wear and tear while offering excellent breathability. The Multicam&reg; fabric, licensed through Crye Industries, ensures a stylish and practical design. This cap features a loop strap on the back, perfect for attaching branch and name tape for personalization. With its U.S. made craftsmanship, it stands up to the demands of active use while maintaining a professional appearance. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from military personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
